Description:It is your first main phase. You have Ahn-Crop Crasher (3/2 haste; you may exert it as it attacks: when you do, target creature can't block this turn) in hand with three red mana floating. The opponent is at 3 life and controls an untapped Wall of Stone (0/8). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-exert-cant-block | Exert is a choice made as the creature is declared as an attacker, and its reflexive trigger resolves before blockers are declared (CR 701.43a, 508.1, 603.12): exert the hasty Crasher targeting Wall of Stone so the Wall can't block and 3 damage lands; attacking without exerting is blocked by the Wall
